# Stable spec ID: iba-pisco-sour. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(pisco) 60 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 30 ml
(simple syrup) 20 ml
(egg: white, raw whole) 1

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(goblet)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (goblet)>
<garnish, with few dashes Amargo bitters>

